			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				870,
				4
			],
			"Message": "build(Mountain): Update binary/lib names and Tauri config for production build profile\n\nRename the Mountain binary and library to include the full production environment profile string (ProductionNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Compile_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) to distinguish this build variant from development builds. Update tauri.conf.json productName and identifier to match, and add Binary/node to externalBin for the production node path.\n\nThis configuration supports the multi-profile build pipeline for distinguishing between development and production environment builds.",
			"SHA": "16bcfef9901bc9c03390b960918014975f74e4aa"
		}
